msgctxt "56_Saejima"
msgid "It's time for me to go."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "68_Sodachi"
msgid "Are you really leaving!?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "80_Saejima"
msgid "I can't just stay here forever. Plus you got a lot more students now, and the dojo's become real impressive."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "92_Saejima"
msgid "You don't need me no more."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "104_Sodachi"
msgid "Oh, no! Please... Please don't go! Don't go, Saejima-san! Nooooooooooo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "116_Sugiyama"
msgid "Sodachi-san... He has no choice. He has other things to do."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "128_Sodachi"
msgid "You're right. It's truly unfortunate... But I guess I should see you off with a smile."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "140_Sodachi"
msgid "Saejima-san... Really, thank you for everything."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "152_Sodachi"
msgid "If it weren't for you, my dojo would not be here today."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "164_Sodachi"
msgid "And not just the dojo. If it weren't for you, these students wouldn't have been able to grow as much as they have."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "176_Sodachi"
msgid "We'll continue to work as hard as we can."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "188_Sodachi"
msgid "You come back and visit anytime you want. We'll always be waiting for you!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "200_Saejima"
msgid "Right. I'll come and check on ya every once in a while to make sure you ain't gone soft. Especially you, Fukushi."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "212_Ochiai"
msgid "What!? Why me!? I'm gonna work harder than ever!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "224_Everyone"
msgid "Hahaha!"
msgstr "¡Ja, ja, ja!"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "236_Saejima"
msgid "I ain't a sentimental man, so I'm only sayin' this once. I'm glad I met all of ya. And I mean that from the bottom of my heart."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "248_Saejima"
msgid "Even after I leave the dojo, our bond ain't never gonna change."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "260_Saejima"
msgid "We'll always be together."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "272_Sodachi"
msgid "Saejima-san..."
msgstr "Saejima-san..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "284_Sodachi"
msgid "Thank you... Thank you so much!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "296_Sodachi"
msgid "This is a little token of appreciation for all that you've done for us. Please, take it on behalf of all of us."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "332_Saejima"
msgid "All right. It's been fun. You guys be good now. See ya around."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "344_Sodachi"
msgid "Come back anytime, Saejima-san. We'll be waiting for you!"
msgstr ""

